@startuml Object Detection and Relationship Inference Sequence

!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #f5f5f5
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

title **Luồng xử lý Nhận diện Đối tượng và Phân tích Mối quan hệ**

actor "Người dùng" as User
participant "GUI\n(ObjectDetectionApp)" as App
participant "YOLOv11\n(detect_objects)" as YOLO
participant "Backbone\n(SPPF Layer)" as Backbone
participant "CLIP\n(ViT-B/32)" as CLIP
participant "ROIAlign\n(Feature Pooling)" as ROI
participant "RelTR\n(Transformer)" as RelTR
database "Output\n(JSON/Image)" as Output

== 1. Khởi tạo hệ thống ==
App -> YOLO : Load model (fine-tune.pt)
YOLO -> Backbone : Register forward hook
App -> CLIP : Load model (ViT-B/32)
CLIP -> CLIP : Pre-compute text features\n(200+ labels)
note right: Animals, Vehicles,\nElectronics, Food, etc.

== 2. Chọn và nhập ảnh ==
User -> App : select_image()
App -> App : display_image()
User -> App : run_pipeline()

== 3. Object Detection với YOLO ==
App -> YOLO : detect_objects(image)
activate YOLO
YOLO -> YOLO : Inference trên ảnh
YOLO -> Backbone : Forward pass
Backbone --> YOLO : Feature Map (C×H×W)
YOLO --> App : Bounding Boxes + Classes
deactivate YOLO

note over YOLO, Backbone
  Global Context Vector = 
  L2_normalize(GAP(feature_map))
end note

== 4. Feature Extraction với ROIAlign ==
App -> ROI : extract_roi_features(feature_map, boxes)
activate ROI
ROI -> ROI : Scale boxes to feature map
ROI -> ROI : roi_align → 7×7 pooling
ROI -> ROI : Adaptive avg pool → 1×1
ROI --> App : ROI Features (per object)
deactivate ROI

== 5. Phân loại với CLIP ==
loop Cho mỗi object được detect
    App -> CLIP : classify_with_clip(cropped_image)
    activate CLIP
    CLIP -> CLIP : encode_image → image features
    CLIP -> CLIP : cosine_similarity(image, text_features)
    alt Confidence >= 0.3
        CLIP --> App : CLIP Label
    else Confidence < 0.3
        CLIP --> App : Fallback YOLO Label
    end
    deactivate CLIP
end

== 6. Relationship Inference với RelTR ==
App -> RelTR : run_reltr_inference(objects, image)
activate RelTR

RelTR -> RelTR : Transform image (Resize 800, Normalize)
RelTR -> RelTR : Forward qua Backbone (ResNet50)
RelTR -> RelTR : Transformer Encoder (6 layers)

group Decoder với Dual Queries
    RelTR -> RelTR : Entity Queries (100 slots)
    RelTR -> RelTR : Triplet Queries (200 slots)
    RelTR -> RelTR : Transformer Decoder (6 layers)
end

RelTR -> RelTR : Relation Logits → Softmax

loop Cho mỗi cặp (object_i, object_j)
    RelTR -> RelTR : Base vector từ rel_logits
    alt ROI features có sẵn
        RelTR -> RelTR : Compute visual similarity
        RelTR -> RelTR : Adjust logits: base × (1 + 0.25×sim)
    end
    RelTR -> RelTR : Argmax → Relationship class
end

RelTR -> RelTR : Filter: similarity >= 0.5
RelTR --> App : Relationships List\n(subject, relation, object)
deactivate RelTR

note over RelTR
  51 Relationship Classes:
  above, near, holding, wearing, 
  riding, part_of, carrying, etc.
end note

== 7. Lưu kết quả ==
App -> Output : result.json\n(objects + features + global_context)
App -> Output : relationships.json\n(filtered triplets)
App -> Output : result.jpg\n(annotated image)

== 8. Hiển thị kết quả ==
App -> App : load_and_display_objects()
App -> App : load_and_display_relationships()
App -> App : draw_relationship_boxes_on_image()
App --> User : Hiển thị kết quả trên GUI

@enduml
